{"unit_id":"m-rui001__dsh-mate-companion#feature-1","repo":"m-rui001/dsh-mate-companion","commit":"a6d715c1bfa6dcd81eb0dadcb3964e0d459c1c5a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persisto Mate companion 的功能「持久记忆」：模型可把关于用户或共同经历的内容写入长期记忆，并附主题标签；后续用户消息会触发回忆与复习。通过 mate_remember 保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-mate-extension/src/index.ts:292-326","packages/dsh-mate-extension/src/index.ts:211-230"]}
{"unit_id":"m-rui001__dsh-mate-companion#feature-2","repo":"m-rui001/dsh-mate-companion","commit":"a6d715c1bfa6dcd81eb0dadcb3964e0d459c1c5a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persisto Mate companion 的功能「私密思考」：模型可用 mate_ponder 写入私人思考和主题标签，形成仅供内部回忆、不进入用户可见摘要的记忆。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-mate-extension/src/index.ts:328-346","packages/mate/src/memory.ts:59-61"]}
{"unit_id":"m-rui001__dsh-mate-companion#feature-3","repo":"m-rui001/dsh-mate-companion","commit":"a6d715c1bfa6dcd81eb0dadcb3964e0d459c1c5a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persisto Mate companion 的功能「情绪自评」：每轮交流后模型可调用 mate_feel，以 -2 到 +2 的刻度报告情绪变化；仅接受上次报告后的新用户交流。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-mate-extension/src/index.ts:360-390"]}
{"unit_id":"m-rui001__dsh-mate-companion#feature-4","repo":"m-rui001/dsh-mate-companion","commit":"a6d715c1bfa6dcd81eb0dadcb3964e0d459c1c5a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Persisto Mate companion 的功能「自主念头」：每分钟内核检查是否应主动表达；若决定 reach_out、未处于抑制状态且有空闲 agent，就排入一条带系统事件标记的后续消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-mate-extension/src/index.ts:252-290"]}
